  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 904.09 Initial Licenses: Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall issue initial licenses in accordance with Plc 304.11.\n\n(b) Initial licenses shall be valid as provided in Plc 304.12.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
